{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Require AI companies to protect photographers\u2019 copyrighted images",
        "additional_details": "Professional photographers rely on watermarked proofs to let customers view photographs before purchasing them.\r\n\r\nAI tools can now remove watermarks and reconstruct images, making it easier to obtain usable copies without paying.\r\n\r\nThis threatens photographers\u2019 livelihoods and undermines the value of their work.\r\n\r\nWe want safeguards that protect copyrighted images while allowing legitimate editing.",
        "background": "We want the Government to require AI image-editing providers to introduce safeguards against the unauthorised removal of photographers\u2019 copyright watermarks and proof markings, where this facilitates copyright infringement.",
